.','Rotate Encryption Key'=>'Rotate Encryption Key','Confirm you want to reset the encryption key to a new value.'=>'Confirm you want to reset the encryption key to a new value.','Confirm Reset Key'=>'Confirm Reset Key','encryption'=>'encryption','Kadence Security will add a constant to your website’s <code>wp-config.php</code> file named <code>ITSEC_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>.'=>'Kadence Security will add a constant to your website’s <code>wp-config.php</code> file named <code>ITSEC_ENCRYPTION_KEY</code>.','Sets a secure key that Kadence Security uses to encrypt sensitive values like Two-Factor codes.'=>'Sets a secure key that Kadence Security uses to encrypt sensitive values like Two-Factor codes.','Set Encryption Key'=>'Set Encryption Key','Run this tool to change the user ID of a user with a user ID of “1”. This may prevent unsophisticated attacks that assume the user with an ID of “1” is an administrator.'=>'Run this tool to change the user ID of a user with a user ID of “1”. This may prevent unsophisticated attacks that assume the user with an ID of “1” is an administrator.','Changes the user ID for the first WordPress user.'=>'Changes the user ID for the first WordPress user.','Enter the new username for the “admin” user.'=>'Enter the new username for the “admin” user.','New Username'=>'New Username','Run this tool to change the username of a user with the “admin” username. This may prevent unsophisticated attacks that assume the “admin” user exists.'=>'Run this tool to change the username of a user with the “admin” username. This may prevent unsophisticated attacks that assume the “admin” user exists.','Changes the username of the “admin” user.'=>'Changes the username of the “admin” user.','Change Admin User'=>'Change Admin User','Could not save Two-Factor secret.'=>'Could not save Two-Factor secret.','Could not encrypt Two-Factor secret.'=>'Could not encrypt Two-Factor secret.','Could not retrieve Two-Factor secret.'=>'Could not retrieve Two-Factor secret.','Two