The requested path already exists as a directory. The directory must be removed or a new file name must be chosen before the file can be written.'=>'%s could not be written as a file. The requested path already exists as a directory. The directory must be removed or a new file name must be chosen before the file can be written.','%s could not be written. Both the fopen/fwrite/flock and file_put_contents functions are disabled on the server. This is a server configuration issue that must be resolved before Kadence Security can write files.'=>'%s could not be written. Both the fopen/fwrite/flock and file_put_contents functions are disabled on the server. This is a server configuration issue that must be resolved before Kadence Security can write files.','%s could not be read. Both the fopen/feof/fread/flock and file_get_contents functions are disabled on the server.'=>'%s could not be read. Both the fopen/feof/fread/flock and file_get_contents functions are disabled on the server.','%s could not be read. It does not appear to be a file.'=>'%s could not be read. It does not appear to be a file.','Permissions for the directory %s could not be read as the fileperms() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.'=>'Permissions for the directory %s could not be read as the fileperms() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.','Permissions for the directory %s could not be read as the directory could not be found.'=>'Permissions for the directory %s could not be read as the directory could not be found.','Unable to remove %s due to an unknown error.'=>'Unable to remove %s due to an unknown error.','Unable to remove %1$s due to the following error: %2$s'=>'Unable to remove %1$s due to the following error: %2$s','The directory %s could not be removed as the rmdir() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.'=>'The directory %s could not be removed as the rmdir() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.','The directory %s could not be created due to an unknown error. This could be due to a permissions issue.'=>'The directory %s could not be created due to an unknown error. This could be due to a permissions issue.','The directory %s could not be created as an existing parent directory could not be found.'=>'The directory %s could not be created as an existing parent directory could not be found.','The directory %s could not be created as the mkdir() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.'=>'The directory %s could not be created as the mkdir() function is disabled. This is a system configuration issue.','The directory %s could not be created as a file with that name already exists.'=>'The directory %s could not be created as a file with that name already exists.','%s could not be read due to an unknown error.'=>'%s could not be read due to an unknown error.','%s could not be read. Both the opendir/readdir/closedir and glob functions are disabled on the server.'=>'%s could not be read. Both the opendir/readdir/closedir and glob functions are disabled on the server.','Do not modify or remove this line'=>'Do not modify or remove this line','Unable to read %1$s due to the following error: %2$s'=>'Unable to read %1$s due to the following error: %2$s','Updates to <code>wp-config.php</code> are disabled via a filter.'=>'Updates to <code>wp-config.php</code> are disabled via a filter.','Kadence Security preserved the following settings as removing them could prevent the site from functioning correctly.'=>'Kadence Security preserved the following settings as removing them could prevent the site from functioning correctly.','Enabled'=>'Enabled','No'=>'No','Yes'=>'Yes','Complete!'=>'Complete!','Low'=>'Low','Medium'=>'Medium','High'=>'High','All'=>'All','Daily Security Digest'=>'Daily Security Digest','To view logs within the plugin you must enable database logging in the Global Settings. File logging is not available for access within the plugin itself.'=>'To view logs within the plugin you must enable database logging in the Global Settings. File logging is not available for access within the plugin itself.','Data'=>'Data','URL'=>'URL','User'=>'User','Time'=>'Time','Details'=>'Details','Site Lockout Notification'=>'Site Lockout Notification','Permanently'=>'Permanently','Release Lockout'=>'Release Lockout','You have been locked out due to too many invalid login attempts.'=>'You have been locked out due to too many invalid login attempts.','Lockout'=>'Lockout','Active Lockouts'=>'Active Lockouts','The message to display to a user when they have been locked out.'=>'The message to display to a user when they have been locked out.','Kadence Security can log events in two different ways. Each has advantages and disadvantages. Database Only logs puts all events in the database with your posts and other WordPress data. This makes it easy to retrieve and process that information, but it can slow down your site if the log table gets very large. File Only logging is very fast, but the plugin does not process the logs itself. That would take far more server resources. For most users or smaller sites, Database Only logging should be fine. If you have a very large site or log processing software, then File Only might be a better option.'=>'Kadence Security can log events in two different ways. Each has advantages and disadvantages. Database Only logs puts all events in the database with your posts and other WordPress data. This makes it easy to retrieve and process that information, but it can slow down your site if the log table gets very large. File Only logging is very fast, but the plugin does not process the logs itself. That would take far more server resources. For most users or smaller sites, Database Only logging should be fine. If you have a very large site or log processing software, then File Only might be a better option.','How should event logs be kept'=>'How should event logs be kept','Both'=>'Both','File Only'=>'File Only','Database Only'=>'Database Only','The message to display to a user when their IP has been flagged as suspicious by the Kadence network.'=>'The message to display to a user when their IP has been flagged as suspicious by the Kadence network.','Your IP address has been flagged as a threat by the Kadence Security network.'=>'Your IP address has been flagged as a threat by the Kadence Security network.','Lockouts'=>'Lockouts','Security error!'=>'Security error!','Hide Security Menu in Admin Bar'=>'Hide Security Menu in Admin Bar','NGINX Conf File'=>'NGINX Conf File','Path to Log Files'=>'Path to Log Files','Days to Keep Database Logs'=>'Days to Keep Database Logs','Community Lockout Message'=>'Community Lockout Message','User Lockout Message'=>'User Lockout Message','Write to Files'=>'Write to Files','Global Settings'=>'Global Settings','You must restart your NGINX server for the changes to take effect.'=>'You must restart your NGINX server for the changes to take effect.','wp-config.php Rules'=>'wp-config.php rules','Get Free API Key'=>'Get a Free API Key','New! Take your site security to the next level by activating Kadence Brute Force Network Protection.'=>'New! Take your site security to the next level by activating Kadence Brute Force Network Protection.','Dismiss'=>'Dismiss','Security'=>'Security','Dashboard'=>'Dashboard','Pro'=>'Pro','Logs'=>'Logs','Advanced'=>'Advanced','Settings'=>'Settings']];